{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:47 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"觀塘和樂邨62歲男子上吊亡。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5be40d3bb49cbc697955dc9b5aafa1c/2026-10/DNSP1005WOLOKEST005.jpg\"/>\n<p>今（21日）中午12時15分，警方接獲報案指，在觀塘和樂邨居安樓一單位，姓梁（62歲）男住戶上吊，警員接報到場，梁妻已將事主解下。事主昏迷被送往聯合醫院，惜經搶救後證實死亡。經初步調查，相信梁男在露台以一條領呔上吊。警方於現場有檢獲遺書。死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主有身體病紀錄。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:59:49.839608+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:47:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:39.330828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:39.330828+00:00","content_hash":"bd775f80ea6e2f3b3b9e4e5486e8cb0994b51521df44860ef7bcb738d5b6f1fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}